    <text>
        <body>
            
            <div1 type="letter">
                
                <pb facs="nei.j4a.1.18"/>

                <note type="curatorial">24 Davis Coll N Y Pub Lib</note> 
                <fw type="curatorial">18</fw>
                
                <opener>
                    <hi rend="caps">R. H. D.</hi>
                
                                                                                                                                            <dateline>July 15th, 1907.</dateline>
                
                
                    <salute>My dear Neihardt:&#8212;</salute>
                </opener>
                    <p>It is good of you to ask me to share your home in the mountains and meet your mother and sister and to bring Mrs. Davis with me.</p>
                    
                    <p>Nothing would give us greater pleasure. That is where I properly belong &#8212; out West &#8212; in the hills, away from the confounded civilized, but <unclear>un-civilizing</unclear> East.</p>
                    
                    <p>The unfortunate thing, however, is the fact that Mr. Munsey's father died a week ago, &#8212; since which time the boss has decided that he needs a long vacation. This makes my presence within striking distance of the office necessary.</p>
                    
                    <p>I can only repeat that I am sorry and that I won't really consider my life complete until I have seen your mother.</p>
                <closer>
                    
                                                                                <salute>Always sincerely yours,</salute>
                
                
                
                    <address>
                        <addrLine>Mr. John G. Neihardt,</addrLine>
                                <addrLine>Savoy, via Spearfish,</addrLine>
                                    <addrLine>South Dakota.</addrLine>
                    </address>
                    
                    <note>M. B.</note>
                </closer>
                                                                    
                                                                    <postscript><opener>P. S. &#8212;</opener> <p>Will you kindly accept through me the appreciation of my wife as well?</p></postscript>

            </div1>
        </body>
        
